      "assessment": {
        "nobel_worthiness": "Identification of CFTR established the molecular cause of cystic fibrosis and transformed both disease biology and rational treatment.",
        "attribution": "The three proposed laureates represent central genetic, molecular, and functional contributions to the discovery.",
        "maturity": "The finding has had decades of replication, mechanistic elaboration, diagnostic value, and therapeutic consequences.",
        "uncertainties": [
